# was tests/p1-ux-gui.test.mjs 'p1-ux GUI: the start screen lists recent files, redraws after a
# missing one, and clears them'. The behaviour is pinned by crates/tandem-app/tests/gui.rs
# the_start_screen_lists_recent_files_drops_a_missing_one_and_clears_them; this walk shows how it
# looks: the list, the notice for the missing file (in its own slot, the cards do not move), the
# redrawn list, and the empty list after Clear.
# Set up copies and a recent list first (never the fixtures themselves):
#   mkdir -p /tmp/tandem-walk-gui/udata && cd /tmp/tandem-walk-gui
